  "job": "Show what customers said, with their name, role and company.",
  "purpose": "Quotes as figure, blockquote and figcaption. single: one large pull quote with an optional wordmark. pair: two quotes divided by a hairline. grid: three shorter quotes in ruled cells. proof: one quote beside one figure. No stars, no stock avatars.",
